OL,3,ANvidia CEO Jensen Huang quits in wake
OL,4,Aof affair with suspected Chinese spy,
OL,5,Aas firm's stocks plunge
OL,6,
OL,7,FJensen Huang has resigned as CEO of
OL,8,Ftech giant Nvidia, the company's board
OL,9,Fsays, with chief financial officer
OL,10,FColette Kress appointed interim boss
OL,12,FThe company's shares have recovered
OL,13,Fsome ground after initially plummeting
OL,14,Fmore than 13% when US markets opened
OL,15,Fshortly after news of Huang's
OL,16,Fresignation
OL,18,FIt comes after the New York Times
OL,19,Freported that he had a second affair
OL,20,Fwith an executive at his own company
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,107,105,200,300,0,100
