OL,3,ANvidia CEO Jensen Huang quits in wake
OL,4,Aof affair with suspected Chinese spy,
OL,5,Aas firm's stocks plunge
OL,6,
OL,7,FOn Sunday, Huang admitted an affair
OL,8,Fwith a woman, who was reportedly from
OL,9,Fanother company and suspected to be a
OL,10,FChinese spy
OL,12,FMeanwhile, Beijing has warned the US
OL,13,Fnot to use the spying allegations as a
OL,14,Fpretext to once again restrict tech
OL,15,Fsales to China
OL,17,FNvidia is already investigating the
OL,18,Faffair Huang has admitted, as is the
OL,19,FFBI. What does Nvidia's code of conduct
OL,20,Fsay?
